+  "raw_rows_sha256": "sha256:2cabfbcaf3fda30f3c474da2f07570f04bb6c13637518d2259488ae0fd1558c7",
+  "what_is_NOT_being_corrected": "exp5866's headline conclusions all stand: the VRAM fit (max error 0.19%), the mode A/B/C taxonomy, the finding that context is the cheap axis (~0.025 MiB/cell vs ~207 MiB/slot), and the recommendation to raise n_ctx to 81920. Both corrections below are to SUPPORTING PROSE, and neither changes a number in the fit or the recommendation.",
+  "upstream_top_level_keys": 35
