+  "could_have_failed": "YES, and the same probe shape at n_ctx=16384 is the documented failure: at K=4, 4*4096 == 16384 == the entire pool, so any non-empty prompt overflows and the server 500s with 'Context size has been exceeded.' A forced-full-budget K=6 run reserves 6*4096 = 24576 tokens of generation, which at 16384 is unsatisfiable by arithmetic. This probe can fail.",
